      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodlawn%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Woodlawn became the 21st incorporated village in Hamilton County in 1941, marking its formal entry into Ohio’s municipal landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
